            <title>[IGNITE-7765] walSegmentSize can be negative in config</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7765</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Grid use default (64Mb) DataStorageConfiguration.walSegmentSize without warnings if negative value specified, for example if in xml specified something like&lt;br/&gt;
